              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">You must have at least one Retainer and one Archer per Knight model. Archers have hand weapon, thrusting spear and heavy armour. They may dismount (-9), and replace their thrusting spear with a longbow (free). When dismounted, they gain the Riding Horses special rule.</characteristic>
