              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Franc Archers have improvised weapon and composite bow. Light armor (+2) Open Order. Levies. Every second unit may exchange composite bow for crossbow (+2).</characteristic>
